### Day 16 Exercise 2: TicketService refactor evidence
### Run Spring Boot first: ./mvnw spring-boot:run
### Every request below was run twice: once on the original TicketService and once on the
### refactored one. The status code and message were identical both times.
###
### NOTE: requests 6, 7 and 10 return 500, not 400/409. That is a pre-existing gap in
### GlobalExceptionHandler (it has no @ExceptionHandler for InvalidRequestException or
### DuplicateResourceException). This exercise did not change it, because changing it would
### change API behaviour instead of only the internal structure.

### 1. Login as seeded admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}


### Copy token from the login response
@token = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE


### 2. Create ticket - observed 201, status defaults to OPEN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Day 16 Refactor Check",
  "description": "Ticket created to prove the refactor did not change create behaviour",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "createdBy": "admin@example.com"
}


### 3. Read the ticket back, uses findTicketOrThrow - observed 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/PASTE_TICKET_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. Update ticket - observed 200 with the new title, priority and status
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/PASTE_TICKET_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Day 16 Refactor Check Updated",
  "description": "Updated through the refactored updateTicket method",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}


### 5. Update with surrounding spaces - observed 200, values stored trimmed
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/PASTE_TICKET_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "   Day 16 Refactor Check Updated   ",
  "description": "   Trimming still happens inside normalizeRequired   ",
  "category": "   Software   ",
  "priority": "   MEDIUM   ",
  "status": "   CLOSED   "
}


### 6. Error path - invalid status
### Observed 500, message: Invalid status: BROKEN. Allowed statuses are: [OPEN, IN_PROGRESS, CLOSED]
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/PASTE_TICKET_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Day 16 Refactor Check Updated",
  "description": "Invalid status should still be rejected",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "status": "BROKEN"
}


### 7. Error path - invalid priority
### Observed 500, message: Invalid priority: URGENT. Allowed priorities are: [LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH]
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/PASTE_TICKET_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Day 16 Refactor Check Updated",
  "description": "Invalid priority should still be rejected",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "URGENT",
  "status": "OPEN"
}


### 7b. Error path - status AND priority invalid
### Observed 500 and the message must mention STATUS, proving status is still checked first
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/PASTE_TICKET_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Day 16 Refactor Check Updated",
  "description": "Status is validated before priority",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "URGENT",
  "status": "BROKEN"
}


### 8. Error path - unknown id on update - observed 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Missing Ticket",
  "description": "Unknown id should still return not found",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "status": "OPEN"
}


### 9. Error path - unknown id on GET - observed 404 (same findTicketOrThrow helper)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/000000000000000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 10. Error path - duplicate title
### Observed 500, message: Ticket title already exists: Cannot access email
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/PASTE_TICKET_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Cannot access email",
  "description": "Duplicate title should still be rejected",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "status": "OPEN"
}


### 11. Error path - blank title, bean validation - observed 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/PASTE_TICKET_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Blank title should fail @NotBlank",
  "category": "Software",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "status": "OPEN"
}


### 12. Filters still work - hasText helper replaced the repeated null/blank checks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 13. Blank filter is ignored, same as before - observed 200 with the full list
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets?status=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 14. Paged list unchanged - observed 200 with the same page metadata
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/paged?page=0&size=3&sortBy=createdAt&direction=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
